d love to go hiking, visit the pyramids, and go swimming at a beautiful beach!<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">John</span>: Wow - that's a lot! You should go!"}, {"time": "48000", "id": 3, "image": "engenn3le04ob05re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: I have no money ... and I have to work, of course.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Peter</span>: Here ...<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: What's this?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Peter</span>: It's a lottery ticket. You should have it.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: Thanks, Peter. <br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Peter</span>: I hope you win!"}], "audiosrc": "engenn3le04ob05re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn3le04ob05re2img03.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}]}, {"template_override": 1, "title": "", "_data": [], "type": "audio", "id": 3, "contents": [{"value": {"images": [], "audiosrc": "engenn3le04ob05re6aud01", "coverimg": "engenn3le04ob05re6img01.jpg"}, "type": "picture"}]}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}], "type": "lab_options"}], "type": "scholar", "id": 0}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "At the Travel Agency", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Taking a Break", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 5, "type": "position"}, {"content": "scholar > Daily Life > Hawaii", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 4, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A1.2", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Accurately explain information about interests, hobbies and preferences in communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Communicates effectively in English about the co