 buildings).<br /><br />   For example, there are pyramids in South America, Central America and Asia.", "type": "describer"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Making and Responding to Suggestions", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You can make and respond to suggestions in casual and formal ways.  <br/>You can use some Wh- or How question words to make suggestions, like <span class=\"italic\">Why don't you ...</span> or <span class=\"italic\">How about ...</span>", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Look at the chart to see what phrases you can use:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Making a Suggestion\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Responding to a Suggestion\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Formal\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">How about ... ?<br /> You could ...</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Great suggestion. <br />I'd rather not ... <br />\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Casual\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Why don't you ... ?<br /> You should ... <br /> Why not ... ? <br/> </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Good idea.<br /> Thanks.  <br />I don't know ... <br />Mm, I don't like ...</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to check back", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to come back another time for something, usually in a store", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: <span class=\"strong\">John</span>: Do you have the new comic? <span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: No, check back next week.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le04ob05aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": " These are words you use to talk about vacations.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "lottery  ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a game in which you buy a ticket and the winning ticket gets money", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Here is a lottery ticket. I hope I win!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le04ob05aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "pyramid", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a very large structure with a square base and sloping sides that meet at the top", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I want to visit the pyramids in Egypt.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le04ob05aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "What's new?", "type": "name"}, {"content": "How are you? ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: <span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: What's new, John? <span class=\"strong\">John</span>: I'm good.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le04ob05aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "hiking", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the activity of walking up a mountain ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'd like to go hiking in the mountains.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le04ob05aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Go online and read about two different pyramids.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a short paragraph about them.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write 6-8 sentences.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your paragraph to your partner.", "ty